{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09434","headline":"种药 · 韦应物","name":"种药","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"好读神农书，多识药草名。\n持缣购山客，移莳罗衆英。\n不改幽涧色，宛如此地生。\n汲井既蒙泽，插楥亦扶倾。\n阴颖夕房敛，阳条夏花明。\n悦翫从兹始，日夕绕庭行。\n州民自寡讼，养闲非政成。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09434.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09434","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}